{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_03",
  "title": "玫瑰報業",
  "storyCode": "MN-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "54922b6eb454ebd64105464c3274f04ec753c5b893400d1c7b31e4a45196d202",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 3上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "眾人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乾杯——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恭喜丫頭獲勝，真是精彩的表現，比現在的老弗強多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是比我強多了——但輪不到你說這個話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼又動起手來了......喂，別吵到旁邊的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊哈哈......都開始扳手腕了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打得不錯，孩子，這杯敬你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊.....謝謝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那種場合還能找出瑟奇亞克的弱點，而且一擊制勝，你做得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戰鬥持續了接近二十分鐘，一直處於劣勢的瑪莉婭能在關鍵的一擊中找出反敗為勝的方法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——很了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒、沒有的事啦......如果不是他穿著那種缺陷型號的護甲，可能還真的無從下手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Jack2型號是我從來沒有聽說過的產品......冷卻系統會導致裝甲極短的癱瘓，那根本就是試驗品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——但瑟奇亞克是個經驗老道的競賽騎士，這種事情並不罕見，他把宣傳品的缺點掩飾得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不用太謙虛了，雖然很粗暴，但騎士競技向來都是結果論的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......瑪莉婭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要高興得太早！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要刻意地去控制心態——不是保持平常心就好了的，你要去主動反省，主動平復心情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......自負自滿這種東西啊，你越是覺得自己沒有，越危險，勝利帶來的影響是你自己都意識不到的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而這份大意......會......麻痺你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明、明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......姑母？你喝醉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我沒有！別叫我姑母！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我贏了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "該死，科瓦爾，你為什麼比半年前還結實了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "修水管修的，不服啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "科瓦爾叔叔，弗格瓦爾德叔叔，佐菲婭姐姐是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭......別喊姑母......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦.....真的喝醉了，真難得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我才沒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得了吧！瑪莉婭，把你姑母抬到後面的沙發上睡會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸......好，好的，姑母......麻煩你抬一下腳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別喊姑母！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“鞭刃”佐菲婭在這裡還有一個綽號叫做“千杯”佐菲婭來著......雖然比不過我就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是是是，“萬兩”弗倫丁，和炎國人喝過一頓以後你就這麼神氣？和年輕姑娘比喝酒，老臉不紅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她的壓力很大......第一次以教練的身份盯著賽場，聽著那個大嘴莫布囉囉嗦嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真讓人懷念......唉，瑪莉婭獲勝之後我總是這麼感歎，我是不是也老了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想什麼呢？我們不是平輩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那看來是真的老了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是啊，離我第一次看著佐菲婭上陣，過去多久了？十二年？十五年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你老了我是沒意見，日子都記不清了，但佐菲婭可沒那麼老啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "九年前的事情吧。血騎士，耀騎士，黑騎士......三屆之前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黑騎士......那個卡普里尼啊，感覺已經是上個時代的名字了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟再往前三屆也全都是她。媒體們也經常把她當做“時代的標杆”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，是那個前所未有的三連冠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，一般的騎士封號可不會用那麼寬泛的字眼，不然肯定會重複的，叫起來多麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但那個萊塔尼亞女人，的確值得奪走“黑”這個字。她根本就是個怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聽說現在跟著某家境外財閥混了，嘖嘖嘖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那樣的根本不算騎士......根本不算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......瑪莉婭，佐菲婭她和你說過她的競賽生涯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，雖然特錦賽每年都有錄影和記錄，但我從沒聽她自己說起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得，我記得那年佐菲婭姑母在十六進八的比賽中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "受了重傷，對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對方是那個“裂隙”騎士，哈，說起來他今年參賽了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......欸！怎麼了怎麼了，好好的慶功宴怎麼開始回憶往事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正都不是什麼好事，就別回憶了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我其實還挺想知道的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然僥倖贏下來了，但是佐菲婭姐姐......好像不太高興......剛才也沒怎麼說話，就一直在喝酒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她一定為我想了很多，我不想辜負她......我想知道她的過去，我想知道她是怎麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦......這方面你倒是挺像你姐姐的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，總能敏銳地察覺到那些不好的事情，然後想把事情變好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後的那一劍，是佐菲婭教你的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不是，其實是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是模仿瑪嘉烈的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？啊，嗯......很明顯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，當然，你們姐妹倆簡直一模一樣，我是不會忘記那一天的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最年輕的冠軍，耀騎士的奇蹟。她靠著一己之力做到了那一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然不是表露得非常明顯，但是佐菲婭也是非常仰慕瑪嘉烈的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本來只是陪侍的她，只為了給自己爭一口氣，來找我們這些老傢伙鍛煉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她參戰，她獲勝，她入圍特錦賽......但是從頭到尾，她都沒有接受任何一家公司的贊助，也沒有向別人開口求助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵呵......即使我去拜託了過去認識的一些小企業，她也都委婉拒絕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......都是些垃圾，拒絕了也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你閉嘴，所以佐菲婭才會被“裂隙”那種人給打敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姑母她......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭，你還不清楚競技騎士究竟需要多少資源......武器和裝備的差距是不可彌補的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑟奇亞克輸給你，也許是因為他被迫穿上了那套有著設計缺陷的護甲——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那假如，他身上的是一套完全沒有破綻，甚至性能更加卓越的騎士護甲，你該怎麼辦？你贏的了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......應該贏不了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭就是面對這樣的對手，完美的盔甲、武器、後勤應援，差距極大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自己累積的裝備，自己磨練的技巧，自己打拼的人脈，她這麼孤立無援地拼著命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們什麼都沒為她做到，眼睜睜看著她負傷，退賽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們能做到什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "馬丁叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少你能幫佐菲婭培養這個丫頭，馬丁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，瑪莉婭會接受一個丟了胳膊，還害得佐菲婭受傷的老馬丁去教她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不——沒有的事！我一直都很尊敬各位！真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔？居然除了你們還有別的客人，真稀奇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這樣會倒閉的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問......您是騎士瑪莉婭·臨光閣下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幸會，瑪莉婭閣下，請問您現在有時間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係，請問有什麼可以幫到您的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您好，我是斯沃瑪公司的代表.......這是我的名片......請騎士閣下過目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很抱歉，之前我司代表送往貴宅邸的邀請函全都沒有回音，迫於無奈，這才唐突造訪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......宅邸啊......沒關係的，也許是......信箱出了點問題，哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，找我的原因是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這樣，我司參與贊助的“群月”騎士團團長非常欣賞閣下先前與瑟奇亞克先生一戰時的表現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在得知閣下尚無所屬後，立刻聯繫商務部門，希望能與閣下洽談入團事宜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......入團？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的......事實上，斯沃瑪公司的首席執行官也迫切希望瑪莉婭·臨光閣下能夠加盟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（科瓦爾，斯沃瑪公司是那個稻草商標的食品公司嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（你去看看你剛才吃的蘇打餅乾反面印著的是啥，老糊塗。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（“群月”也是百強騎士團之一......不過根本不是靠競賽，是一群靠廣告和贊助過活的無聊商人......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然不止如此，瑪爾特卡西米爾總部的宣傳部門也允諾，如果瑪莉婭·臨光閣下點頭同意，會與斯沃瑪共同贊助騎士團的發展......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪、瑪爾特，是那個瑪爾特嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，如果閣下還有什麼疑問，可以隨時諮詢我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔......我居然......我睡了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，佐菲婭姐姐，你醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也沒多久啦，才十分鐘而已......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這可不行，特錦賽之前的積分還需要規劃，必須要在這個月獲得——唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......佐菲婭？是、是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊。我對你有印象，你是那個年輕的小經理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不不......不再是了，我只是個......為斯沃瑪跑腿的無名小卒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來是這樣，瑪莉婭閣下的教練正是鞭刃騎士，那就更好不過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“群月”騎士團全部都是像二位這樣的年輕騎士，比起單純的戰鬥，企業商務部門有更多方法讓各位彰顯價值......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可聽上去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......就是當明星，偶像，變成城際網路大紅人，沒人會在意你的競賽成績，他們只會看到你的臉，然後大把掏錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣也行......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "市場就是這樣的，用九成預算請個代言人，找個剽竊對象，打點虛假造勢的廣告......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "簡單，而且有效得超乎你的想像。你都不知道到底是誰有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......淺顯一些理解的話，是這樣。但斯沃瑪公司可以代表商業聯合會向閣下承諾，依舊會頒發騎士勳位與封號給閣下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼突然，我也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說真的......也許你可以接受，瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不需要受傷也能保住臨光家的貴族地位，這不是挺好的嗎？說不定明年你就能買一處比我家還大的花園了哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭姐姐的花園都那個樣子了，就算我買個更大的，也只會變成草地吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒、沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要瑪莉婭閣下現在點頭答應，立刻就有一份價值不菲的合約可以簽署，這點請放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉......我不想讓臨光家的族徽成為商業公司的附屬品。至少，我想靠自己的實力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......呃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑪莉婭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，佐菲婭姐姐，我知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然我並不喜歡瑪恩納叔叔的做法，但我也不能讓姐姐和爺爺的堅持失去意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以......抱歉，我認為自己並不適合您提出的道路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您......閣下做出這種判斷，的確出乎預料......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但、但是，商業聯合會為您準備了更多的合約——您可以一一過目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......商業聯合會？這種事不是協會負責嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......您、您能明白嗎？這也是首席執行官堅持希望您能加盟我們的原因......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......但是，抱歉，恕我婉拒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是、是的，我聽到了，對，您拒絕了......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個，佐菲婭閣下，瑪莉婭閣下......這已經是公務之外的事情了，請二位聽我一言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，您好像在牙齒打顫......別、別哭啊？拒絕你也不至於這麼嚴重吧......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，沒、沒有，我只是希望，如果之後還有人來找二位，特別是來找瑪莉婭閣下洽談的話，請——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——請儘量考慮答應下來！真的！這對我們都很重要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_109#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那、那麼，在我失態之前，容我告退......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪有還要幫別家公司說話的道理......真是奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_120",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊......真是奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......瑪莉婭，下一場比賽是什麼時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三天之後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對手是誰？協會有通知過你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......好像沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們回去吧，瑪莉婭，根據這次的表現，你還有很多地方需要糾正。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_101",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在？慶功宴還沒好好地慶祝呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "科瓦爾，先讓她們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_107#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佐菲婭，記得多留個心眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我知道，走了，瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，等等我啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......英格拉？“鏽銅”英格拉？國民院又放過他了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真不愧是被大企業贊助的騎士......被他打成殘廢的維多利亞人一定會憤憤不平吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_106",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過......倒也正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生們，女士們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有保障，沒有規則，沒有限制！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡除了有兩個自帶鎧甲的騎士和一個賽場，沒有任何其他多餘的東西！規則，條款，善後，防護措施，全都沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "作為卡西米爾騎士錦標賽最重要的預賽項目，我們的選拔賽事已經進行了三個月之久，但參賽者依然源源不絕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但就算這樣，我也要說，今天我們要看到的和以往可不一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們面前的，可是兩位來自古老家族的騎士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喔，喔，我聽到各位的噓聲了。不要緊！比賽的趣味性，我可以拿自己所有的職業素養來保證！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要聽到他們的名字，你們就一定會歡呼！我就是敢這麼保證！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我們看一看，這一方的選手——是英格拉家的老么，奧爾默·英格拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒錯，沒錯，就是無數次因為把人打成殘廢進了審判堂，卻又無數次憑著企業獻金被侍從國民院一致判為無罪的“鏽銅”英格拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "來自沸血騎士團的競技場屠夫，從未讓對手安然退場的殘暴騎士！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他的鎧甲，他的施暴，以及他的殘忍，會打進每一個對手的心裡！以及骨頭裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而另一邊，另一邊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦~哦~！現存最古老的騎士家族之一！臨光！讓我們呼喊他們的名字，臨光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "憑一人的智慧對抗萊塔尼亞的卡西米爾英雄，刺殺侍從叛國者的無光騎士，明明身為耀騎士卻因感染了礦石病而被流放的恥辱象徵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些，都出自她的家族！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？對歷史不感興趣？好！那麼在之前，尚未贏得封號就擊敗了呼嘯騎士團大先鋒瑟奇亞克的人，是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有著呼嘯競技場本月最高人氣的騎士，是誰！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這一切，是否會在這場比賽發生改變？那張精緻的貴族臉蛋，會不會被“鏽銅”毆打到面目全非？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我們歡迎——瑪莉婭·臨光——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼這場戰鬥最後的結果會是什麼？究竟會是誰的勝利？點開你們座位旁的終端，為他們投票吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_121#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老規矩！雖然付費支持也不能決定比賽的結果，但能決定你們的錢夾會是空空如也還是鼓起大包！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——瑪莉婭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能不能......能不能放棄？聽姐姐這一次吧，至少這一戰....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......姑母？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_061#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然已經上陣......騎士不應當退縮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "加油吧，瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓所有人看看你的本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
